        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "At the project level, we expect to be supplying the IMSR Plant design, key components (such as the IMSR Core-unit and associated systems), the IMSR Fuel Salt, and services, many under long-term contract arrangements as described below.",
        "start_character": 39878,
        "end_character": 40113
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036846",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036846-6daeeca429d46cea",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036846",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our business model is based on the supply of nuclear reactor systems, fuel, and engineering services to owner-operator customers who are responsible for securing all necessary regulatory approvals.",
        "start_character": 59361,
        "end_character": 59558
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036846",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036846-6daeeca429d46cea",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036846",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our customers will be IMSR Plant project developers who are also likely to be the owner-operators of the IMSR Plant to whom we plan to provide engineering and construction services and supply fuel and key components.",
        "start_character": 10380,
        "end_character": 10596
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036846",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036846-6daeeca429d46cea",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036846",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our customers will be the owner-operators of the IMSR Plants to which we provide pre-construction and construction engineering services and supply of fuel and major components.",
        "start_character": 37277,
        "end_character": 37453
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036846",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036846-6daeeca429d46cea",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036846",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To provide supply chain resilience, we have engaged with other fuel vendors for similar services, and with those offering fuel transport packaging and shipping services, unenriched uranium supply, and enrichment services.",
        "start_character": 50161,
        "end_character": 50382
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036846",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036846-6daeeca429d46cea",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036846",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Until our successful completion of the Canadian Vendor Design Review (VDR) process described below, we focused on the CNSC regulatory process as it was accessible mid-design to a nuclear plant developer and aligned well with our business objectives.",
        "start_character": 60561,
        "end_character": 60810
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036846",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036846-6daeeca429d46cea",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036846",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We anticipate generating early-stage revenue through the supply of site- and use-specific engineering services to IMSR Plant projects to support project development, construction and procurement planning, and the preparation of USNRC construction permits.",
        "start_character": 41119,
        "end_character": 41374
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036846",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036846-6daeeca429d46cea",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036846",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We anticipate supplying the IMSR Plant design for construction, the IMSR Core-unit and IMSR Fuel Salt as well as O&M services.",
        "start_character": 71924,
        "end_character": 72050
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036846",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036846-6daeeca429d46cea",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036846",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our TETRA pilot reactor was selected as it was a direct product of our R&D integrated design process that since its creation in 2013 also integrates the licensing requirements for IMSR plant operation as well as the capabilities of our IMSR plant supply chain;",
        "start_character": 74618,
        "end_character": 74889
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036846",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036846-6daeeca429d46cea",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036846",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to provide services at the end of IMSR Plant operating life to assist with the decommissioning of the IMSR Plant and its spent IMSR Fuel Salt.",
        "start_character": 43921,
        "end_character": 44073
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036846",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036846-6daeeca429d46cea",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036846",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result of the IMSR Plant’s distinct operating characteristics, we believe that it will offer improved affordability and cost-competitiveness of nuclear energy supply relative to new nuclear plants built with legacy and other Gen IV nuclear technologies, and in doing so, address the economic obstacles to the deployment of new nuclear plant and the expansion of nuclear supply to meet demand.",
        "start_character": 86909,
        "end_character": 87306
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-036846",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-036846-6daeeca429d46cea",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-036846",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As we pursue international commercial opportunities for our IMSR Plant and engage with cross-border development partners, we will continue to maintain internal policies and compliance mechanisms designed to ensure adherence to all applicable regulatory requirements.",
